# Seated Crowd

The stadium is populated by ~11.5k static (frozen-pose) sitting characters placed on every non-wheelchair / non-companion seat. They are authored as a **single `UsdGeomPointInstancer`**, not as per-seat scene-graph instances, so the file is small (~1 MB), Hydra renders the whole crowd in 9 instanced draw calls (one per prototype), and density swaps are O(1) in USD ops.

## File map

| File | Role |
|------|------|
