| `Assets/People/PeopleSitting/bake_skinning.py` | Bakes UsdSkel-skinned characters into static frozen-pose `.usdc` (one per prototype). Final pass relativizes every `asset` path so the files are portable across machines — see "baked `.usdc` files must contain *relative* asset paths" pitfall below. |
